# - Table 1 mixes values taken from the literature (Cormorant, SEGNN, SchNet, EGNN, Equiformer, DimeNet++, SphereNet, the original ET, PaiNN, Allegro, MACE) with the paper's own; only the TensorNet and new-ET rows are encoded. The text adds that the optimised TensorNet gives 3.8(2) meV against the originally published 3.9(1) meV, so the 3L* value may itself be the earlier published one.
# - The MD17 aspirin check of the Equivariant Transformer (test MAE 0.139 kcal/mol for the energy; the force value was cut off in the text read) and the hyperparameter tables for MD17 and QM9 (Tables 3-5) are not encoded.
